          "id": "n7",
          "shape": "hex",
          "x": 230,
          "y": 530,
          "w": 300,
          "h": 100,
          "text": "You can only know a program's behavior by running it",
          "size": "lg",
          "sub": "computational irreducibility",
          "detail": "Because this is ubiquitous even in simple systems, bounded analysis will always eventually be surprised.",
